Changed the `console_ports`, `console_server_ports`, `power_ports`, `power_outlets`, `interfaces` and `device_bays` filters on `DeviceTypeFilterSet`, and the `local_config_context_data` filter on `LocalContextModelFilterSetMixin`, from `method=`-based `BooleanFilter` to `RelatedMembershipBooleanFilter`. Results are unchanged; the filters are now introspectable and covered by the generic boolean filter test.
Replaced the `method=` implementations of the following filters with plain declarations, so they are introspectable, derive `distinct` automatically, and can be used by Dynamic Groups without a companion `generate_query_` method. Results are unchanged unless noted: `LocationFilterSet.subtree` and `ControllerManagedDeviceGroupFilterSet.subtree` (now `TreeNodeMultipleChoiceFilter`; results no longer carry tree ordering), `ApprovalWorkflowStageDefinitionFilterSet.approval_workflow`, `ConsoleConnectionFilterSet.location` and `PowerConnectionFilterSet.location`, `PrefixFilterSet.vpn_tunnel_endpoints_name_contains` (now accepts multiple values), `ObjectMetadataFilterSet.value` (now accepts multiple values), and `IPAddressFilterSet.virtual_machine` and `virtual_machine_id` (an unknown virtual machine is now a validation error instead of an empty result).
Replaced the `method=` implementations of `has_primary_ip` (Device, VirtualMachine, VirtualDeviceContext), `vlan_id` and `vlan` (Interface), `vlan_id` (VMInterface), `termination_a_id`, `termination_b_id` and `termination_id` (Cable), and `device` (Module) with the new `MultiField*` filter classes. Results are unchanged; `vlan_id`, `vlan` and the VMInterface `vlan_id` filters now accept multiple values and reject non-UUID/non-numeric input with a validation error instead of a database error.
